# The GIFs are regenerable from the committed telemetry:
#   python3 ../sitl/render.py mission-telemetry.json mission.gif "title" "sub"
# They are 5-8 MB each and would bloat the history for no gain. The telemetry
# JSON they are rendered from IS committed, because that is the evidence.
*.gif
# PNGs ARE committed: they are small, and they are the readable evidence.
!*.png
